<!--tz-meta {"id":"ex-hero","title":"Hero — Factory Floor","category":"Elixir","file":"elixir/hero.heex","tags":["heex","phoenix","hero","brutalist","editorial"],"description":"Offset industrial hero: giant Anton headline slammed against a rotated safety-orange serial plate, spec manifest down the side.","dnas":["industrial-brutalist"]} -->
<%!-- def hero(assigns) — attr :eyebrow, :string, default: "FIELD UNIT 001" · attr :headline, :string · attr :standfirst, :string · attr :cta_label, :string · attr :cta_href, :string · attr :specs, :list, default: [] --%>
<%!--
Design read: A factory-floor hero for Latch — oversized condensed type pinned against a safety-orange serial plate, specs running down a side manifest like a machine door stenciled with its own data.
Distinctive choice: the rotated "UNIT 001" plate overlapping the headline's first line, like a stamp slapped on after the paint dried.
Dials: VARIANCE 8 / MOTION 4 / DENSITY 5. DNA: industrial-brutalist (Anton / Space Grotesk / JetBrains Mono).
--%>
<style>
@import url("https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Anton&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;600&display=swap");
.tz-hero {
  --tz-bg: #d8d8d4;
  --tz-surface: #c9c9c4;
  --tz-ink: #141412;
  --tz-muted: #5c5c58;
  --tz-accent: #ff4d00;
  --tz-line: #141412;
  --tz-font-display: "Anton", "Arial Narrow", sans-serif;
  --tz-font-body: "Space Grotesk", "Helvetica Neue", sans-serif;
  --tz-font-mono: "JetBrains Mono", "SFMono-Regular", monospace;
  background: var(--tz-bg);
  color: var(--tz-ink);
  font-family: var(--tz-font-body);
  border-bottom: 2px solid var(--tz-line);
  overflow: hidden;
}
.tz-hero__grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(12, 1fr);
  max-width: 1440px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}
.tz-hero__main {
  grid-column: 1 / 9;
  padding: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 6rem) clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 4rem) clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5rem);
  border-right: 2px solid var(--tz-line);
  position: relative;
}
.tz-hero__plate {
  display: inline-block;
  background: var(--tz-accent);
  color: var(--tz-bg);
  font-family: var(--tz-font-mono);
  font-weight: 600;
  font-size: 0.78rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.14em;
  padding: 0.55rem 1rem;
  transform: rotate(-2.5deg);
  margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
  box-shadow: 5px 5px 0 var(--tz-ink);
  animation: tz-hero-plate-in 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1) both;
}
.tz-hero__headline {
  font-family: var(--tz-font-display);
  font-size: clamp(3.4rem, 9.5vw, 8.5rem);
  line-height: 0.94;
  letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  margin: 0 0 1.75rem;
  max-width: 12ch;
  animation: tz-hero-rise 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1) 0.08s both;
}
.tz-hero__headline .tz-hero__strike {
  color: transparent;
  -webkit-text-stroke: 2px var(--tz-ink);
}
.tz-hero__standfirst {
  font-size: 1.13rem;
  line-height: 1.55;
  max-width: 44ch;
  color: var(--tz-ink);
  margin: 0 0 2.25rem;
  animation: tz-hero-rise 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1) 0.16s both;
}
.tz-hero__actions {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 1rem;
  align-items: center;
  animation: tz-hero-rise 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1) 0.24s both;
}
.tz-hero__cta {
  display: inline-block;
  background: var(--tz-ink);
  color: var(--tz-bg);
  font-family: var(--tz-font-mono);
  font-weight: 600;
  font-size: 0.95rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  text-decoration: none;
  padding: 1rem 1.75rem;
  box-shadow: 6px 6px 0 var(--tz-accent);
  transition: transform 0.18s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1), box-shadow 0.18s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);
}
.tz-hero__cta:hover {
  transform: translate(-2px, -2px);
  box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 var(--tz-accent);
}
.tz-hero__note {
  font-family: var(--tz-font-mono);
  font-size: 0.8rem;
  color: var(--tz-muted);
}
.tz-hero__manifest {
  grid-column: 9 / 13;
  background: var(--tz-surface);
  padding: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 6rem) clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 0;
}
.tz-hero__manifest-title {
  font-family: var(--tz-font-mono);
  font-size: 0.75rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 0.18em;
  color: var(--tz-muted);
  margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}
.tz-hero__spec {
  border-top: 1px solid var(--tz-line);
  padding: 1.1rem 0;
  animation: tz-hero-rise 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1) both;
}
.tz-hero__spec:last-child {
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--tz-line);
}
.tz-hero__spec-label {
  font-family: var(--tz-font-mono);
  font-size: 0.72rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  color: var(--tz-muted);
  text-transform: uppercase;
  margin: 0 0 0.35rem;
}
.tz-hero__spec-value {
  font-family: var(--tz-font-display);
  font-size: 1.9rem;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  margin: 0;
}
.tz-hero__spec-value em {
  font-style: normal;
  color: var(--tz-accent);
}
@keyframes tz-hero-rise {
  from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(22px); }
  to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
}
@keyframes tz-hero-plate-in {
  from { opacity: 0; transform: rotate(-9deg) scale(0.85); }
  to { opacity: 1; transform: rotate(-2.5deg) scale(1); }
}
@media (max-width: 900px) {
  .tz-hero__main { grid-column: 1 / 13; border-right: none; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--tz-line); }
  .tz-hero__manifest { grid-column: 1 / 13; }
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  .tz-hero__plate, .tz-hero__headline, .tz-hero__standfirst, .tz-hero__actions, .tz-hero__spec {
    animation: none;
  }
  .tz-hero__cta { transition: none; }
}
</style>
<section class="tz-hero" aria-label="Introduction">
  <div class="tz-hero__grid">
    <div class="tz-hero__main">
      <span class="tz-hero__plate">{@eyebrow}</span>
      <h1 class="tz-hero__headline">
        Send the invoice. <span class="tz-hero__strike">Get paid.</span> Go home.
      </h1>
      <p class="tz-hero__standfirst">{@standfirst}</p>
      <div class="tz-hero__actions">
        <.link href={@cta_href} class="tz-hero__cta">{@cta_label} →</.link>
        <span class="tz-hero__note">Free for your first 5 invoices · no card needed</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <aside class="tz-hero__manifest" aria-label="Latch at a glance">
      <p class="tz-hero__manifest-title">Manifest — read before operating</p>
      {for {spec, i} <- Enum.with_index(@specs) do}
        <div class="tz-hero__spec" style={"animation-delay: " <> to_string(0.1 + i * 0.08) <> "s"}>
          <p class="tz-hero__spec-label">{spec.label}</p>
          <p class="tz-hero__spec-value">{spec.value}</p>
        </div>
      {/for}
    </aside>
  </div>
</section>
